@binance now puts the hack at about $6.3 billion.

The Bybit hack in February 2025 was $1.5 billion. This is about four times that, and bigger than any prior crypto theft on public record.

About $3 billion is frozen so far. @binance says it will cover every loss from its SAFU https://t.co/OMh1ynV8V0
